### Team Ledger API Tests
### Prerequisites: API running on port 3000, dev login enabled

### 1. User A dev-login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "dev_user_a_001",
  "nickname": "玩家A"
}

### 2. User B dev-login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "dev_user_b_002",
  "nickname": "玩家B"
}

### 3. User C dev-login
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/dev-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "dev_user_c_003",
  "nickname": "玩家C"
}

### ==========================================
### Use User A's token below
### ==========================================

@token_a = <user_a_jwt_token>

### 4. User A creates a team ledger room
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

{
  "title": "周末线下牌局"
}

### Response: get roomCode from response
@roomCode = <roomCode>

### 5. User B joins the room
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/join
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_b}}

{}

### 6. User C joins the room
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/join
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_c}}

{}

### 7. Owner adds a temp player (现场玩家D)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/add-temp
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

{
  "displayName": "现场玩家D"
}

### 8. Get room details
GET http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 9. Owner starts the ledger room
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### ==========================================
### Hand #1
### ==========================================

### 10. User A submits entry: +300
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/entry
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

{
  "amount": 300
}

### 11. User B submits entry: -100
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/entry
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_b}}

{
  "amount": -100
}

### 12. User C submits entry: -200
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/entry
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_c}}

{
  "amount": -200
}

### 13. Check balance (should be 0, balanced)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 14. Owner requests confirmation
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/request-confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 15. User A confirms
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 16. User B confirms
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_b}}

### 17. User C confirms
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_c}}

### Hand #1 should now be LOCKED

### ==========================================
### Hand #2
### ==========================================

### 18. Owner creates next hand
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/next-hand
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 19. User A submits: -50
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/2/entry
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

{
  "amount": -50
}

### 20. User B submits: +150
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/2/entry
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_b}}

{
  "amount": 150
}

### 21. User C submits: -100
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/2/entry
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_c}}

{
  "amount": -100
}

### 22. Check balance (should be 0)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/2/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 23. Request confirm, then A, B, C confirm
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/2/request-confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 24. Confirm (repeat for token_a, token_b, token_c)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/2/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### ==========================================
### Summary & Settlement
### ==========================================

### 25. Get summary (A: +250, B: +50, C: -300)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 26. Generate settlement suggestions
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/settlement
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 27. End the room
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### 28. Close the room
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

### ==========================================
### Edge Cases
### ==========================================

### Test: Imbalanced entries (sum != 0)
### Create new room, start, submit unbalanced amounts
### Should fail when trying to request-confirm

### Test: Dispute flow
### Submit balanced entries → request confirm → B disputes → check status
### POST .../hands/N/dispute with note="金额不对"
### Should reset confirm status for all

### Test: Non-owner cannot start/end room
### Should return 403 Forbidden

### Test: Non-participant cannot see room details
### Should return 404 or 403

### Test: Owner submits entry for temp player
POST http://localhost:3000/api/team-ledger/rooms/{{roomCode}}/hands/{{handNo}}/entry-temp/{{participantId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token_a}}

{
  "amount": 500
}
